---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "../components/layout/Section.astro";
import Container from "../components/layout/Container.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";
import ClassifiedBand from "../components/ui/ClassifiedBand.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../components/typography/Eyebrow.astro";
import Heading from "../components/typography/Heading.astro";
import Rule from "../components/typography/Rule.astro";
import PitchDeckNav from "@/components/ui/PitchDeckNav.astro";
import "@/styles/global.css";
import ThreatBand from "@/components/ui/ThreatBand.astro";
import SmallProfileCard from "@/components/characters/SmallProfileCard.astro";
import PitchDeckLayout from "@/layouts/PitchDeckLayout.astro";


---
<PitchDeckLayout
  title="MI5 Interception Log — The Collateral"
  eyebrow="Supporting Cast Profiles"
  classificationLabel="TOP SECRET — MI5 INTERCEPTION LOG // SPECIAL INTEREST SUB-FILES"
  currentPath="/supporting-cast"
>
  <p  slot="header">The diplomat. The spiritual escape pod. The vulnerable shield. The
    un-spayable anchor. Four people caught in the blast radius of aconspiracy none of them knows exists.
  </p>

  <!-- ─── 2×2 GRID ─── -->
  <Container>
  <div class="supporting-grid">
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- PAUL MCCARTNEY — TOP LEFT -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <SmallProfileCard 
      name="PAUL MCCARTNEY" 
      role="The Unwitting Diplomat"
      q="We just need to organize a bit, lads. Set a schedule. We're a family, aren't we? If we just show up at nine every morning, we can patch this all up before tea."
      src="/paul.jpg"
      photoLabel="CALENDAR // TIMELINE // ORGANIZER"
      ribbon="AXIS OF CREATIVE DIVISION: RE-ROUTE OPERATIVE RESOURCES"
      style="--spc-heading: var(--accent-blue-light);"
      stampText="STATUS: TARGET \nORGANIZATIONAL DISRUPTOR /\nSYSTEM STABILIZATION"
      stampPosition={4}
    >
    <ThreatBand
      line1="MI5 FIELD LOG // COVERT PSYCHOLOGICAL NUDGES"
      line2="THE DIPLOMAT VS. THE DISCIPLINARY COUNTER-MEASURE"
      dashes={200}
      slot="band"
    />
    <div>
      <h5>The Stance</h5>
      <p>
        Bright-eyed, meticulously groomed, and fiercely productive. Armed
        with an absolute work ethic, a piano-driven pop sensibility, and a
        desperate, anxious need to keep his surrogate musical family from
        breaking apart.
      </p>
      <h5>The Threat Profile</h5>
      <p>
        <strong>High Operational Stability.</strong> Paul is the engine keeping
        the Beatles alive. If he succeeds in organizing the band, their soft-power
        cultural influence will endure indefinitely. To defeat the band, MI5 knows
        they must break Paul's spirit.
      </p>
    

      <h5>The Target of Manipulation</h5>
      <p>
        In 1969, Nigel Finch exploits Paul's hidden establishment anxieties
        by forging a classified palace memo hinting that the Queen intends
        to bypass John and offer Paul a solo knighthood. Flattered but
        deeply suspicious, Paul completely misinterprets the landscape —
        wrongly accusing Yoko Ono of orchestrating a plot to divide the
        band, entirely blind to the MI5 agents pulling the strings.
      </p>
    </div>
    </SmallProfileCard>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- GEORGE HARRISON — TOP RIGHT -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <SmallProfileCard
      name="GEORGE HARRISON"
      role="The Spiritual Escape Pod"
      q="It's all just maya, anyway. Illusion. We're shouting at each other over guitar solos while the universe is vibrating on a completely different frequency. I'm going to my garden."
      src="/george.jpg"
      photoLabel="INCENSE // SANSKRIT // FREQUENCY SHIFT"
      ribbon="AXIS OF CREATIVE DIVISION: RE-ROUTE OPERATIVE RESOURCES"
      style="--spc-heading: var(--orange-2);"
      stampText="EVALUATION: \nIDEOLOGICAL DRIFT DETECTED \nENCOURAGE SITAR STUDIES"
      stampPosition={2}
    >
      <ThreatBand
        line1="MI5 FIELD LOG // COVERT PSYCHOLOGICAL NUDGES"
        line2="THE DIPLOMAT VS. THE DISCIPLINARY COUNTER-MEASURE"
        dashes={200}
        slot="band"
      />
      <h5>The Stance</h5>
      <p>
        Meditative, creatively stifled, and increasingly distant. Armed with
        a newly acquired sitar, an obsession with Eastern mysticism, and a
        growing resentment toward the Lennon-McCartney songwriting monopoly.
      </p>
      <h5>The Threat Profile</h5>
      <p>
        <strong>Accidental Revolutionary.</strong> George doesn't care about the
        British Empire or the Crown; he just wants creative respect. Yet, his
        journey into avant-garde spiritualism makes him the easiest wedge for
        intelligence operations to exploit.
      </p>
      <h5>The Comedic Feedback Loop</h5>
      <p>
        George is the victim of the show's funniest backfire. To isolate him
        from the band, Nigel Finch clumsily plants a text on Indian
        philosophy on George's amplifier. Instead of neutralizing him, the
        nudge works <em>too well</em>: it triggers George's lifelong
        devotion to the sitar and Eastern faith, introducing an entirely
        new, deeply influential psychedelic sonic palette to the band's
        music. <strong>MI5 literally invents raga-rock by accident.</strong>
      </p>
    </SmallProfileCard>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- BRIAN EPSTEIN — BOTTOM LEFT -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
     <SmallProfileCard
      name="BRIAN EPSTEIN"
      role="The Vulnerable Shield"
      q="The press will be here any moment. We simply cannot afford another… misunderstanding. The boys must remain respectable. I've given everything to make them respectable."
      src="/brian.jpg"
      photoLabel="DECEASED // FILE CLOSED // SHIELD TERMINATED"
      ribbon="AXIS OF CREATIVE DIVISION: RE-ROUTE OPERATIVE RESOURCES"
      stampText="ANALYSIS: \nSTABILITY RATING: CRITICAL \nPROTECTED ASSET CLASS"
      stampPosition={6}
    >
      <ThreatBand
        line1="MI5 INTERCEPTION LOG // SPECIAL INTEREST SUB-FILES"
        line2="THE IMMACULATE SHIELD VS. THE IMMUNE ANCHOR"
        dashes={200}
        slot="band"
      />
      <h5>The Stance</h5>
      <p>
        Immaculate, intensely anxious, and paternal. Armed with tailored
        Savile Row suits, a pristine upper-middle-class public relations
        veneer, and a tragic, deep-seated fear that the boys' raw
        working-class irreverence will ruin the empire he built for them.
      </p>
      <h5>The Threat Profile</h5>
      <p>
        <strong>The Ultimate Fortress.</strong> As long as "Eppy" manages the
        band's finances and protects their public image, MI5 cannot penetrate
        their inner circle. He is the sophisticated mediator standing between
        working-class genius and upper-class malice.
      </p>
      <h5>The Narrative Tragedy</h5>
      <p>
        Brian's sudden, unexpected overdose in August 1967 is the dark,
        structural turning point of the series. His death leaves the four
        boys completely unprotected, creating a massive vacuum that allows
        Clive Barrow and the state apparatus to aggressively step in and
        accelerate the band's internal bleeding.
      </p>
    </SmallProfileCard>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- RINGO STARR — BOTTOM RIGHT -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
     <SmallProfileCard
      name="RINGO STARR"
      role="The Un-Spayable Anchor"
      q="I just want to play the drums, look after my mates, and make sure everyone's had a nice cup of tea. Why is that fellow over there staring at my hi-hat with a clipboard?"
      src="/thebeatles08.jpg"
      photoLabel="IMMUNE // NO USEFUL NEUROSES"
      ribbon="AXIS OF CREATIVE DIVISION: RE-ROUTE OPERATIVE RESOURCES"
      style="--spc-heading: var(--text-accent);"
      stampPosition={3}
    >
      <ThreatBand
        line1="MI5 INTERCEPTION LOG // SPECIAL INTEREST SUB-FILES"
        line2="THE IMMACULATE SHIELD VS. THE IMMUNE ANCHOR"
        dashes={200}
        slot="band"
      />
      <h5>The Stance</h5>
      <p>
        Unflappable, grinning, and completely normal. Armed with a steady
        rhythm, a genuine lack of ego, and an uncomplicated, bulletproof
        sense of working-class decency.
      </p>
      <h5>The Threat Profile</h5>
      <p>
        <strong>Absolute Immunity.</strong> Ringo is the ultimate cryptographic
        nightmare for MI5. Because he has zero political ambition, no existential
        crises, and no desire for creative control, he is entirely immune to psychological
        warfare.
      </p>
      <h5>The Comedic Irony</h5>
      <p>
        While Clive Barrow spins elaborate, multi-layered conspiracies to
        drive the band mad, Ringo consistently defuses the psychological
        traps through sheer, accidental common sense. He shows up on time,
        plays his parts perfectly, and remains the emotional anchor of the
        group. MI5 spends millions of pounds trying to calculate a
        counter-measure for a man whose only motivation is to make his
        friends happy.
      </p>
    </SmallProfileCard>
    </div>
  </Container>

</PitchDeckLayout>

<style>
  /* ─── 2×2 GRID ─── */
  .supporting-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2px;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  /* ─── INK STAMP ─── */
  .ink-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12rem;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-red);
    color: var(--color-red);
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
    opacity: 0.5;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .ink-stamp--ringo {
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-size: var(--fs1);
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .supporting-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ink-stamp {
      bottom: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      font-size: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
